//
// Pack an encoding table:
//	- only code lengths, not actual codes, are stored
//	- runs of zeroes are compressed as follows:
//
//	  unpacked		packed
//	  --------------------------------
//	  1 zero		0	(6 bits)
//	  2 zeroes		59
//	  3 zeroes		60
//	  4 zeroes		61
//	  5 zeroes		62
//	  n zeroes (6 or more)	63 n-6	(6 + 8 bits)
